sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant W as TrackController (wayside)
    participant V as attached vital code
    participant M as SwTrackController
    participant H as Central Harness
    participant TM as Track Model
    Note over W,V: Within a scan (UC-09), after the program has set SIG_s_R, _Y, _G, _SG.
    W->>V: SIG_s_R, _Y, _G, _SG, OCC_b, CLOSED_b
    V->>V: exactly one aspect lit, and the block clear and open?
    alt yes
        V->>V: OUT_ aspect bits := the program's
    else no
        V->>V: OUT_SIG_s_R := 1, the others 0
    end
    V->>V: OUT_HALF_b := yellow
    V-->>W: OUT_SIG_s_*, OUT_HALF_b
    W->>W: OS encode: the one lit aspect
    W-->>M: aspects
    M-->>H: signal_commands (line, block): red, yellow, green, super_green
    H->>TM: signal aspect
